        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <title>Bark Buddy Security Alert</title>\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"/>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f4f6; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n  <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f2f4f6;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 20px 0;\">\n        \n        <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-width: 90%;\">\n          \n          <tr>\n            <td bgcolor=\"#D32F2F\" style=\"padding: 25px; text-align: center;\">\n              <div style=\"font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">🚨</div>\n              <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase;\">Barking Detected</h1>\n              <p style=\"color: #ffcdd2; margin: 5px 0 0; font-size: 14px;\">Action Required: Check on your pet</p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 30px;\">\n              \n              <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;\">\n                Your <strong>Bark Buddy</strong> system has detected sustained noise levels consistent with barking or growling.\n              </p>\n\n              <div style=\"background-color: #FFF3E0; border: 1px solid #FFCC80; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n                <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #E65100; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">AI Confidence Score</span>\n                <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #D84315; margin-top: 5px;\">{{ $json.score }}</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #E65100;\">Positive Detections</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 25px 0;\">\n\n              <p style=\"color: #999999; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: center;\">Home Environment Status</p>\n\n              <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-right: 8px;\">\n                    <div style=\"background-color: #F8F9FA; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                      <div style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">🌡️</div>\n                      <div style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold;\">\n                        {{ $('Webhook').item.json.query.temp }}°C\n                      </div>\n                      <div style=\"color: #888888; font-size: 12px;\">Temperature</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                  \n                  <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 8px;\">\n                    <div style=\"background-color: #F8F9FA; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                      <div style=\"font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">💧</div>\n                      <div style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold;\">\n                         {{ $('Webhook').item.json.query.hum }}%\n                      </div>\n                      <div style=\"color: #888888; font-size: 12px;\">Humidity</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr>\n            <td bgcolor=\"#37474F\" style=\"padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n              <p style=\"color: #CFD8DC; font-size: 12px; margin: 0;\">\n                Event Recorded: <strong>{{ new Date().toLocaleString() }}</strong>\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"color: #90A4AE; font-size: 11px; margin: 10px 0 0;\">\n                Bark Buddy Automated System\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n\n        <div style=\"height: 40px; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px;\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
